From: PonWrt developers <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] profile: enable bridge offload and diagnostics tools

Enable nft bridge flowtable support and the bridge conntrack module needed
for Wi-Fi to LAN L2B PPE offload. Include conntrack, full ethtool and Chinese
LuCI translations for the firewall and package manager.

Signed-off-by: PonWrt developers <noreply@localhost>
---
diff --git a/configs/hg5585f-ct.config b/configs/hg5585f-ct.config
index f82db3f..e3a6d84 100644
--- a/configs/hg5585f-ct.config
+++ b/configs/hg5585f-ct.config
@@ -25,6 +25,12 @@ CONFIG_PACKAGE_wpad-openssl=y
 CONFIG_PACKAGE_wireless-regdb=y
 CONFIG_PACKAGE_airoha-en7581-npu-firmware=y
 CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-nft-offload=y
+CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-nft-bridge=y
+CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-nf-conntrack-bridge=y
+CONFIG_PACKAGE_conntrack=y
+CONFIG_PACKAGE_ethtool-full=y
+CONFIG_PACKAGE_luci-i18n-firewall-zh-cn=y
+CONFIG_PACKAGE_luci-i18n-package-manager-zh-cn=y
 CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-nf-flow=y
 CONFIG_PACKAGE_luci=y
 CONFIG_PACKAGE_luci-theme-bootstrap=y
